<h2>SKILL.md Structure and the Description</h2>
<p>The center of a skill folder is the <code>SKILL.md</code> file, and alongside it sit bundled files such as <code>reference</code>, <code>examples</code>, and <code>scripts</code>.</p>

<h3>Front matter (metadata)</h3>
<div class="diagram">
<svg viewBox="0 0 640 210" role="img" aria-label="Anatomy of SKILL.md: the front matter (name and description) is always loaded, the body (instructions) is loaded on call">
